# --- generated and vendored runtime assets ---------------------------------
# These are produced by `predev`/`prebuild` (npm run assets | env | icons):
#   public/mediapipe/wasm, public/draco, public/basis  ← copied from node_modules
#   public/hdr/studio.hdr                              ← gen-studio-env.mjs
#   public/icons, public/favicon.svg, public/apple-touch-icon.png ← gen-icons.mjs
# Committing them would put ~15 MB of regenerable binaries in every clone.
public/mediapipe/wasm/
public/draco/
public/basis/
public/hdr/
public/icons/
public/favicon.svg
public/apple-touch-icon.png

# --- binary app assets that DO belong in the repo --------------------------
# (negated on purpose: fetch-assets.mjs verifies them by hash and cannot download
#  them — the upstream host is not reachable from every build environment.)
!public/models/facecap.glb
!public/mediapipe/face_landmarker.task

# --- throwaway verification output -----------------------------------------
# tools/out holds renders from the probe tools; they are regenerated on demand.
tools/out/
